# SwiftUI Engine

SwiftUI is driven by Identity, Lifetime and Dependencies.

Before generating code:

- Identify which views own state.
- Preserve stable view identity whenever the domain object remains the same.
- Prefer changing data over replacing view types.
- Structural changes should represent domain changes.
- Treat body recomputation as inexpensive.
- Never optimize by avoiding body evaluation.
- Avoid expensive work inside body.
